          "id": "c06-R02",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "病或速作、不必服第四次、因病未作則可",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c06-R03",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "截、病旣作則不可截、或病者身體太弱、恐",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c06-R04",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "或隨服隨嘔、宜每次服三厘、照期分兩日",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c06-R05",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "服、旣截後、凡每日一作者、自病截日起、計",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c06-R06",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "至第七日、恐或復發、是日宜預早服此藥",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c06-R07",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "三四次、每次比前少些、自此服藥日起、又",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c06-R08",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "計至七日、仍恐復發、照式服藥、直計至第",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c06-R09",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "三四次之七日、仍須服藥、其間一日作者、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c06-L01",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "自病截前一日起計、每至十四日、或復發",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c06-L02",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "仍照式服藥以截之、又法、服信石酒一錢",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c06-L03",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "至一錢半、須於朝晨及作冷前、每服一次、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c06-L04",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "亦可截、截後恐或復發、仍計七日之期以",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c06-L05",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "截之、此二法、屢試屢驗、但截後覺口苦頭",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c06-L06",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "疼、及各般身體不安、宜服輕瀉藥以鬆之、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c06-L07",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "自然全愈、此種瘧症、常有定期、西國人多",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c06-L08",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "患此症、屢經細察、故知如此、愚見中土人",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c06-L09",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "患此症者、亦覺愈後復發、恰照定期、特中",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c06-L-folio",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "folio",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "二",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c06-R-folio-v020",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "folio",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "一",
          "bbox": null
        }
      ],
      "uncertainties": [
        {
          "id": "c06-v020-point-01",
          "unit_id": "c06-L01",
          "start": 17,
          "end": 18,
          "surface": "發",
          "candidates": [
            "發",
            "發、"
          ],
          "reason": "欄末發右下靠書脊及底框的墨痕難分字末、黏墨或刻點；十四日後點可定，此欄末點已回圖未解，暫保留初錄無點。",
          "cause": "point-shape-unresolved",
          "extent": "known",
          "note": "已回圖未解；相鄰實字是刻點缺席疑讀之錨。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_id": "c07",
      "index": 7,
      "width": 2200,
      "height": 2025,
      "official_label": "pp. [10]-[11]",
      "canvas_id": "https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/07855068-9f44-4ce8-8494-fc635975ffd0.json",
      "image_url": "https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/image/07855068-9f44-4ce8-8494-fc635975ffd0/full/2200,/0/default.jpg",
      "source_sha256": "afe199a17aa9fafa8c07b405238a3c46dd043e6612cd654bb26840b5fb878ca6",
      "layout_note": "右面九直欄，前五欄收束瘧症治法說明，後四欄開始金雞納霜；左面九直欄。左面第二欄開頭與第四欄末各有雙行小註。右面版心二、左面三。",
      "layout_reviewed": true,
      "layer_states": {
        "original-print": "reviewed-with-unresolved-readings"
      },
      "units": [
        {
          "id": "c07-u01",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "土人習而不察、故以爲擺子往來無定、歸",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c07-u02",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "咎於醫藥寡効、及戒口不淸耳、茲特將醫",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c07-u03",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "藥治法、詳晰並錄、俾知醫有妙藥、治有定",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c07-u04",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "法、而着手生春焉、並附金雞納霜信石酒",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c07-u05",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "製法於後、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c07-u06",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "金雞納霜、出自南亞美利駕、樹名金雞納",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c07-u07",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "霜乃其樹皮所出、西國藥肆、用價沽此",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c07-u08",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "樹皮、昔時多是研末作散、或用煎湯、近",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c07-u09",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "則多方泡製、得其樹皮之精漿、故名曰",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c07-u10",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "霜、其價頗昂、現年比前數年價平一半、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c07-u11",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "note",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "大約三四換",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c07-u12",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "其性不寒不熱、色白、味苦、功力",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c07-u13",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "全補、是治擺子第一妙藥也、平常發熱、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c07-u14",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "卽潮熱、於每日熱退時、服一二分、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c07-u15",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "note",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "分兩三次",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c07-u16",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "極有應驗、又凡人不論甚麼病後欠補、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c07-u17",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "及戒洋烟後欠補、朝晚飯前每服二厘、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c07-u18",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "可補元氣、戒洋烟藥丸、斷不可少此一",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c07-u19",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "味、河南□洲興盛行常有發兌、每樽",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c07-u20",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "約八錢、價銀二員半、如買十樽、價銀二",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c07-R-folio-v020",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "folio",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "二",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c07-L-folio-v020",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "folio",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "三",
          "bbox": null
        }
      ],
      "uncertainties": [
        {
          "id": "c07-v020-unc-1",
          "unit_id": "c07-u19",
          "start": 4,
          "end": 5,
          "surface": "□",
          "candidates": [
            "鰲",
            "鼇"
          ],
          "reason": "hi-c07上部敖可辨，下部魚／黽的外側折筆與底筆不能無疑區分；停止按地名補定。",
          "cause": "reading-unresolved",
          "extent": "known",
          "note": "已回圖未解；單字或刻點位置已定位。"
        }
