    {
      "page_id": "c08",
      "index": 8,
      "width": 2200,
      "height": 2025,
      "official_label": "pp. [12]-[13]",
      "canvas_id": "https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/c8f5b06a-3698-49b3-ad38-c0d552114c15.json",
      "image_url": "https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/image/c8f5b06a-3698-49b3-ad38-c0d552114c15/full/2200,/0/default.jpg",
      "source_sha256": "b91189852dc39848695298c7154ae43ffb6921ff31f304f5c67fb2c04e8e1529",
      "layout_note": "右面先續金雞納霜價格，再列信石酒方：第二直欄同欄有藥名、劑量、小字白者佳和濃酒二錢；第三欄列滾水及製法。第四欄為小腸疝症題，後五欄及左面九欄為正文。外側葉碼右三、左四。",
      "layout_reviewed": true,
      "layer_states": {
        "original-print": "reviewed"
      },
      "units": [
        {
          "id": "c08-u01",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "folio",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "三",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c08-u02",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "十員、封密貯好、雖久可用、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c08-u03",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "title",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "信石酒、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c08-u04",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "信石三厘",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c08-u04-N01-v020",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "note",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "白者佳",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c08-u05",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "濃酒二錢",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c08-u06",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "滾水一兩四錢",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c08-u07",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "共製爲酒功力全補",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c08-u08",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "title",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "　論小腸疝症",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c08-u09",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "小腸疝乃小腸離了本位、從肚腹軟弱處",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c08-u10",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "偪出、或在臍、或在左右大腿與肚腹相連",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c08-u11",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "處、或在腎囊、但在腎囊者恒多、初起時小、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c08-u12",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "愈久愈大、有歷年後大如人頭者、其故或",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c08-u13",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "因大力欬嗽、或因大小便出力過多、或因",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c08-u14",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "提重物所傷、治法、不須服藥、病者宜高肩",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c08-u15",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "捲腿而卧、不使患處緊掣、醫者或以指、或",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c08-u16",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "以手心送入、外用小腸夾緊壓、長久勿鬆、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c08-u17",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "年少者一年後不再發、不須更夾、倘常夾",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c08-u18",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "或嫌疲苦、或有微痛、用藥酒擦、臨夜睡時",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c08-u19",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "鬆下此夾、朝來夾番纔起、因起立不夾、恐",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c08-u20",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "小腸復墜、至若小腸有時不能送還本位、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c08-u21",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "蓋因筋帶緊勒小腸所出之路、血不通行、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c08-u22",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "痛關生死、治法雖是大費工夫、仍須用夾",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c08-L-folio-v020",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "folio",
          "side": "left",
          "text": "四",
          "bbox": null
        }
      ],
      "uncertainties": []
    },
    {
      "page_id": "c09",
      "index": 9,
      "width": 2200,
      "height": 2025,
      "official_label": "p. [14] and inside lower cover",
      "canvas_id": "https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/2d30b9c3-d0fa-4135-bb9a-31569c1bbdd0.json",
      "image_url": "https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/image/2d30b9c3-d0fa-4135-bb9a-31569c1bbdd0/full/2200,/0/default.jpg",
      "source_sha256": "781801988471ef5284ddb36409c96f5d0fb7a6033d700f04ef3f5e45fcd89bc3",
      "layout_note": "右面五直欄為小腸疝末文，第五欄較短。右面下半有帶狀鋼夾示意圖，其上橫題由右至左讀。外側版心葉碼四。左面內封未見原刊印字。",
      "layout_reviewed": true,
      "layer_states": {
        "original-print": "reviewed"
      },
      "units": [
        {
          "id": "c09-u01",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "folio",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "四",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c09-u02",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "夾住、夾之大小、須量人之肥瘦恰合爲宜",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c09-u03",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "愚見中土人醫此症、止用湯藥、偶可止痛、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c09-u04",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "而不能令小腸送還本位、曷不令巧匠照",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c09-u05",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "式仿造鋼夾、依法治之、乃爲有益也、並附",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c09-u06",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "body",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "鋼夾圖於後、",
          "bbox": null
        },
        {
          "id": "c09-u07",
          "layer": "original-print",
          "role": "figure-label",
          "side": "right",
          "text": "治小腸疝偏右鋼夾圖",
          "bbox": null
        }
      ],
      "uncertainties": [],
